WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.872
Salom.

2
00:00:01.872 --> 00:00:06.528
Bu darsda differensial tenglama nima ekanini ko‘ramiz.

3
00:00:06.528 --> 00:00:15.302
Oxirida siz tenglamaning tartibini aniqlay olasiz va berilgan funksiya yechim ekanini o‘rniga qo‘yib tekshira olasiz.

4
00:00:15.552 --> 00:00:18.768
Stakandagi choy xonada soviydi.

5
00:00:18.768 --> 00:00:22.656
Choy qancha issiq bo‘lsa, shuncha tez soviydi.

6
00:00:22.656 --> 00:00:29.448
Sovish tezligi, ya’ni harorat hosilasi, choy va xona harorati farqiga proporsional.

7
00:00:29.448 --> 00:00:35.198
Noma’lum narsa son emas, balki vaqtga bog‘liq harorat funksiyasi.

8
00:00:35.448 --> 00:00:37.776
Erkli o‘zgaruvchi,

9
00:00:37.776 --> 00:00:45.096
noma’lum funksiya va uning hosilalarini bog‘lovchi tenglama oddiy differensial tenglama deyiladi.

10
00:00:45.096 --> 00:00:51.312
Tenglamada qatnashgan eng yuqori hosilaning tartibi tenglamaning tartibi bo‘ladi.

11
00:00:51.312 --> 00:00:54.240
Tartibni darajadan farqlang.

12
00:00:54.240 --> 00:01:04.512
Daraja faqat tenglama hosilalarga nisbatan ko‘phad ko‘rinishiga keltirilganda aniqlanadi; shunda u eng yuqori tartibli hosilaning darajasidir.

13
00:01:04.512 --> 00:01:12.710
Masalan, ildiz ostidagi yoki sinus ichidagi hosila bo‘lsa, odatdagi ma’noda daraja aniqlanmaydi.

14
00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:19.896
Misol: ikkinchi hosilaning kubi qo‘shuv x ko‘paytirilgan birinchi hosila teng sinus x.

15
00:01:19.896 --> 00:01:24.096
Eng yuqori hosila ikkinchi, demak tartib ikki.

16
00:01:24.096 --> 00:01:31.406
Tenglama hosilalarga nisbatan ko‘phad va eng yuqori hosila kub darajada, demak daraja uch.

17
00:01:31.656 --> 00:01:34.488
Endi yechimni tekshiramiz.

18
00:01:34.488 --> 00:01:42.552
y teng C ko‘paytirilgan e daraja ikki x funksiyasi y shtrix teng ikki y tenglamaning yechimimi?

19
00:01:42.552 --> 00:01:46.680
Hosilasini olamiz: ikki C e daraja ikki x.

20
00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:50.472
Uni o‘rniga qo‘yamiz: ayirma nolga teng.

21
00:01:50.472 --> 00:01:54.086
Demak, istalgan C da bu yechim.

22
00:01:54.336 --> 00:01:59.328
Grafikda C ning turli qiymatlari uchun yechimlar ko‘rsatilgan.

23
00:01:59.328 --> 00:02:03.312
Har bir egri chiziq integral chiziq deyiladi.

24
00:02:03.312 --> 00:02:06.384
Ular bir-birini kesib o‘tmaydi.

25
00:02:06.384 --> 00:02:11.966
C nolga teng bo‘lganda y aynan nol bo‘ladi, bu ham yechim.

26
00:02:12.216 --> 00:02:15.048
Endi o‘zingizni tekshiring.

27
00:02:15.048 --> 00:02:21.950
Ekrandagi savolga javob bering, keyin videodan pastdagi savolda javobingizni belgilang.
